DESCRIPTION:Will AI replace comedians? Don McMillan definitively answers th
 at question in this year’s Tour that features Fresh Charts\, Graphs\, Ven
 n Diagrams and Lots of Laughs! Don McMillan isn’t your typical stand-up c
 omic. A former Silicon Valley engineer turned viral sensation\, Don blends 
 his technical background with razor-sharp wit to deliver what’s been call
 ed “The Funniest PowerPoint Presentation You’ll Ever See!” Recently f
 eatured on America’s Got Talent\, Don made it to the Top 12 and performed
  in the Finals\, earning rave reviews from all the judges—including Simon
  Cowell. Don’s comedy is smart\, clean\, and wildly relatable. His YouTub
 e videos attract fans from all over the world. His signature video\, “Lif
 e After Death by PowerPoint\,” has been viewed by more than 50 million ti
 mes and has made him a favorite among corporate audiences including Apple\,
  Microsoft\, Amazon and Google. Don won the San Francisco International Com
 edy Competition and has also appeared on The Tonight Show\, HBO\, Comedy Ce
 ntral and was the First Dry Bar comedian to surpass 1 million Instagram fol
 lowers\, a milestone unmatched by many of his peers.\nMore info: https://co
 medyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/don-mcmillan-31915/
